# Build context is the repo root. Send only what the images need.
*
!apps/server
!data/grammar

# What the web stage of apps/server/Dockerfile needs: apps/web, the workspace
# packages it builds against, and the manifests pnpm checks for --frozen-lockfile.
!apps/web
!packages
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!package.json
!turbo.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!.npmrc

# Local build/spike output never goes into the image; the web stage rebuilds everything.
# (These come after the allowlist, so they win: the copied trees arrive without node_modules,
# dist, .turbo or .expo junk.)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-web*
**/.turbo
**/.expo
apps/server/bin
apps/server/scripts
apps/server/Dockerfile
